<main>
  <section class="about-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="eyebrow">About Us</div>
      <h1>We are not artists. We are the very ground from which art rises.</h1>
      <p>Botaki Ba Afrika is a collective, not a gallery. Every piece we make belongs to the group before it belongs to any one artist.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap story-grid">
      <div class="ph" role="img" aria-label="Collective image placeholder"></div>
      <div class="story-copy">
        <div class="eyebrow">Our story</div>
        <h2 class="heading" style="font-size:24px;">Built by the community, for the community</h2>
        <p>Botaki Ba Afrika started as a handful of neighbours sharing tools, instruments, and pages of half-finished poems. What began informally grew into a standing collective spanning four disciplines — visual art, music, literature, and crafts.</p>
        <p>We don't operate around individual names. Every project is shared, every rehearsal is open, and every piece carries the collective's mark rather than a single signature.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="stats-band">
    <div class="wrap section stats-grid">
      <div class="stat-card"><div class="num">2014</div><div class="label">Founded</div></div>
      <div class="stat-card"><div class="num">40+</div><div class="label">Artists</div></div>
      <div class="stat-card"><div class="num">4</div><div class="label">Disciplines</div></div>
      <div class="stat-card"><div class="num">120+</div><div class="label">Projects</div></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="who-are-we">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 class="eyebrow" style="font-size:26px; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--ink); font-weight:800;">Who Are We</h2>
      <div class="how-grid">
        <div class="stripe-col-row" aria-label="Choose a color">
          <button class="stripe" style="background:var(--yellow)" type="button" aria-label="Yellow"></button>
          <button class="stripe" style="background:var(--orange)" type="button" aria-label="Orange"></button>
          <button class="stripe" style="background:var(--brown)" type="button" aria-label="Brown"></button>
          <button class="stripe" style="background:var(--green)" type="button" aria-label="Green"></button>
        </div>
        <div class="how-copy">
          <p>Four disciplines, one collective. Visual art, music, literature, and crafts feed into each other rather than staying in their own lane — a mural might borrow a rhythm, a poem might describe a weave.</p>
          <div class="btn-row">
            <a href="botaki-ba-afrika.html#disciplines" class="btn btn-primary">See our disciplines</a>
            <a href="botaki-ba-afrika.html#projects" class="btn btn-secondary">View projects</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="eyebrow">The people</div>
      <h2 class="heading" style="font-size:24px;">A few faces from the collective</h2>
      <div class="team-grid" style="margin-top:32px;">
        <div class="team-card">
          <div class="team-avatar"></div>
          <div class="name">Name</div>
          <div class="role">Visual Art</div>
        </div>
        <div class="team-card">
          <div class="team-avatar"></div>
          <div class="name">Name</div>
          <div class="role">Music</div>
        </div>
        <div class="team-card">
          <div class="team-avatar"></div>
          <div class="name">Name</div>
          <div class="role">Literature</div>
        </div>
        <div class="team-card">
          <div class="team-avatar"></div>
          <div class="name">Name</div>
          <div class="role">Crafts</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-band">
    <div class="wrap cta-inner">
      <h2>Want to join the collective or collaborate on a project?</h2>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary">Get in touch</a>
        <a href="blog.html" class="btn btn-secondary">Read our journal</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

